# Temple of Power counts red sources as they were when they dealt the damage (CR 609.7, the ruling's "at the time the damage
# was dealt"). Bot1 cast Ojer Axonil on turn 1 (Mox Ruby, Mountain, Mox Pearl, Mox Jet); Bot2 cast Ornithopter and killed it on
# turn 2 with two Lightning Bolts, and it came back tapped and transformed as Temple of Power (CR 712.14a). Bot1 casts Walking Ballista with X = 2 on turn 3. Turn 7: the Ballista, colorless, removes a
# counter to deal 1 to Bot2; then Painter's Servant, choosing red, makes it red. Lightning Bolt deals 3 to Bot2: 4 noncombat
# damage from sources that are red now, but only 3 from a source that was red as it dealt it, so the Temple is refused with
# mana to pay. Firebolt's 2 makes 5 and it transforms.

